WEBVTT

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:01.940
Gainos.

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:04.500
The ruling continent of the Queen's capital.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.820
For the purpose of becoming the new Queen, many warriors are aiming for that place.

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:12.230
They place within their swords the feelings of ambition that are hidden within them.

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:15.720
Thus, the burning competition, Queen's Blade, continues.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:22.870
kagata kure hikaru yo mayoi wo uchi keshite

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:22.870
かがたくれ光るよ迷いを打ち消し

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:22.870
The blazing light will chase the doubts away

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:31.590
yowake ga kuru no nara osorezuni kono DOOR wo hirakao

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:31.590
よわけが来るのなら恐れ済みこのドアを平子

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:31.590
And when the dawn comes the door will open

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:47.590
Moshimo itsuka hohoende kureru hi ga kuru nara

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:47.590
もしもいつか微笑んでくれる日がくるなら

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:47.590
If there ever comes a day where you can smile

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:54.110
sore wa kitto nani ka ga kawatte shunkan

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:54.110
それはきっと何かが変わって瞬間

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:54.110
Something will definitely change in that moment

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:59.780
tsuyoku naritai no negau yori mo ima wa

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:59.780
強くなりたいの願うよりも今は

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:59.780
It is now my wish to become strong

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:06.410
tada tsuyoku naru no ka watashi dake ga moteru

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:06.410
ただ強くならのか私だけが持てる

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:06.410
Is becoming strong all that I can hope for?

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:12.580
kotae wo shiritai

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:12.580
答えを知りたい

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:12.580
I want to know the answer

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:19.470
kagata kure hikaru yo mayoi wo uchikeshite

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:19.470
かがたくれ光るよ迷いを打ち消し

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:19.470
The blazing light will chase the doubts away

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:25.720
omoi de bakari wo nazoru dake ja naku

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:25.720
重いでばかりを謎るだけじゃなく

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:25.720
My feelings do nothing but puzzle me

00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:31.900
kore kara kaerareru mirai ga hajimaru

00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:31.900
是から帰られる未来が始まる

00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:31.900
From now on I will change, my future is beginning

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:42.000
yoake ga kuru no nara osorezuni kono DOOR wo hiraka wo

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:42.000
夜明けが来るのなら恐れずにこのドアを平鹿

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:42.000
And when the dawn comes, the door will open

00:01:57.490 --> 00:01:58.700
Nanael-san!

00:01:58.700 --> 00:01:59.180
Gasp!

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:02.660
Y-Yo, Hachi.

00:02:02.660 --> 00:02:03.470
What is it?

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:05.640
The Head Angel is calling for you.

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:07.800
Eh? The Head Angel?

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:11.230
It seems that Nanael has been called by the Head Angel again.

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:16.460
It may be about the prior match where Lightning General Claudette fought Vagrant Warrior, Leina.

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:18.030
Yes, I heard about that.

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:21.190
Nanael forced them to fight against their will.

00:02:21.190 --> 00:02:22.740
You don't say!

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:26.220
To think that she would actually fabricate a Queen's Blade match...

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:28.620
She will certainly be banished to the Land of the Dead, won't she?

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:30.920
Sh! The criminal will hear you!

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:33.710
I already heard all of it, anyway.

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:36.050
Are you prepared to listen?

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:40.300
The purpose that we angels are called to serve

00:02:40.770 --> 00:02:44.600
is the supervision and broadcasting of the Queen's Blade competition.

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:49.390
You forced them to fight in spite of knowing all of this.

00:02:49.670 --> 00:02:52.200
This will not be tolerated.

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:54.270
Do you understand, Nanael?

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:56.190
Ah, yes!

00:02:56.560 --> 00:02:59.170
It does not seem as though you understand...

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:01.860
the true purpose of Queen's Blade.

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:06.280
As messengers of God, we angels are allowed to reside in heaven.

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:10.920
And below us, the humans live on the surface world.

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:14.860
Long ago, the surface world fell into chaos.

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:19.110
To quell this chaos, God created Queen's Blade.

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:25.120
The one who won these battles was ordained the strongest and most beautiful Queen,

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:26.600
and would rule over the continent.

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:37.010
In other words, this competition exists for the sake of protecting the continent.

00:03:37.010 --> 00:03:39.000
That is Queen's Blade.

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:40.570
Nanael-san!

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:49.410
It seems as though Nanael would very much like to plunge into the Land of the Dead.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:51.160
L-Land of the Dead?

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:52.630
That's right.

00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:55.350
An abyss much more twisted than the surface world.

00:03:55.350 --> 00:03:57.690
A land full of wicked creatures.

00:03:57.690 --> 00:03:59.710
That is the Land of the Dead.

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:04.630
Head angel-sama! Anything, <i>anything</i> but that!

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:06.630
Even now, the true nature of those tears

00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:08.010
hold no real emotion.

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:09.890
She saw right through me...

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:14.140
Nanael, I shall give you the terms of your last chance.

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:15.350
Chance?

00:04:15.740 --> 00:04:17.480
Presently, on the surface world,

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:21.480
the subordinates of the Witch of the Swampland have begun moving suspiciously.

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:24.820
Assassin of Innumerable Changes, Melona.

00:04:25.190 --> 00:04:26.970
Princess of Ancient Times, Menace.

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:29.490
Maid of Temptation, Airi.

00:04:30.150 --> 00:04:35.300
Using these three demons, her scheme to rule the continent will be set in motion.

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:36.960
That is the Witch of the Swampland.

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:42.880
Her workings in the surface world could eventually bring calamity to Heaven.

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:47.990
Therefore, I am assigning Nanael this special task.

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:52.260
You shall return to the surface world, and travel to the swampland in which the witch dwells.

00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:53.270
The swampland?

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:57.560
The swampland is a place that even the eyes of God cannot see.

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:03.150
There, you will confirm the current movements of the Witch of the Swampland.

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:06.080
Then, if I do a good job, you won't send me to the Land of the Dead?

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:07.310
Very well.

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:08.490
I shall recognize your deeds.

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:10.490
Okay then! Leave this to me!

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:12.950
Hachielle, you shall accompany Nanael wherever she goes.

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:15.080
Eh!?

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:18.030
You will oversee her and command her as you will.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.420
Ah, yes.

00:05:22.910 --> 00:05:24.400
It's quite creepy, isn't it?

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:26.910
Okay! We'll just zoom down there!

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:30.090
But it looks like going through that cloud is impossible, right?

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:31.640
Eh?

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:43.900
Going there would be a waste of time.

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:46.030
How about we don't and just report that we did?

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:47.740
But Nanael-san,

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:50.380
if you were found out, this time you'd really be sent to the Land of the Dead.

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:52.620
Gasp! T-That's true...

00:05:53.140 --> 00:05:54.190
I can see it now!

00:05:56.600 --> 00:06:00.050
That tower over there is the Witch of the Swampland's castle, right?

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:03.070
Uwa, it's kind of eerie...

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:06.210
Why do I have to go to a place like that?

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:11.320
If that's the case, I'll fly over there and get the job over with quickly!

00:06:11.320 --> 00:06:13.430
It would be better if you didn't!

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:17.730
Those turbulent clouds look really dangerous!

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:19.190
What? I'm fine, I'm fine!

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:21.060
You're going to get hit by lightning!

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:29.070
That's why I told you...

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:34.780
Nanael-san?

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:36.990
Huh?

00:06:36.990 --> 00:06:39.580
I was certain she fell around here, but...

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:47.170
Just now, I think I heard something.

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:05.230
That is the entrance to the Land of the Dead...

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:06.150
Demon's Gate.

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:10.960
It appears to be a demonic gateway, but it really is ominous.

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:40.350
What a nice temperature!

00:07:48.210 --> 00:07:50.080
H-Help me!

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:51.440
Somebody!

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:54.280
Grab onto the belt!

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:55.730
Hurry!

00:07:57.610 --> 00:07:58.240
Yes!

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:10.090
I've been saved.

00:08:10.410 --> 00:08:12.140
Just barely, right?

00:08:12.140 --> 00:08:13.800
I'm glad I made it in time.

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:17.320
Um... You are...?

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:19.010
Leina, Angel-san.

00:08:19.530 --> 00:08:21.060
Could it be...

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:23.140
You're the Vagrant Warrior, Leina?

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:25.630
Are you an acquaintance of Nanael's?

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:26.510
Yes.

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:32.780
I apologize on behalf of the angels for all the trouble Nanael-san has caused you.

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:37.620
That was no one's fault.

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:40.240
It was a result of my own weakness.

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:42.480
You're so cool!

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:44.910
As expected of Vagrant Warrior, Leina!

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:47.320
Um...

00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:50.210
Could you please stop with that 'Vagrant Warrior' stuff?

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:50.790
Eh?

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:53.810
That is just something Nanael made up on her own.

00:08:53.810 --> 00:08:56.760
I was never participating in Queen's Blade in the first place.

00:08:56.990 --> 00:08:58.480
That's such a waste!

00:08:58.480 --> 00:09:02.760
You're so strong, you could surely win and become Queen!

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:04.820
You're too kind.

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:06.390
The complete opposite of Nanael.

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:08.550
Well then, I'm going, okay?

00:09:08.550 --> 00:09:14.240
Um, from here onwards it's all swampland, so it would be better to take a different path.

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:16.190
I understand. Thank you.

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:25.280
This is heavenly, just heavenly!

00:09:25.280 --> 00:09:28.250
To think a spring was around this hellish place.

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:29.830
But even so...

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:31.250
That thing from earlier...

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:35.600
Just what was that?

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:41.110
Ah, this is such a nice spring.

00:09:41.690 --> 00:09:42.760
Right?

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:45.680
This was my personal recommendation, the "Hell's Blood Bath."

00:09:46.840 --> 00:09:49.250
Oh, Airi, why aren't you coming in?

00:09:50.030 --> 00:09:52.400
This water is just a little too hot.

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:55.160
Such a spoiled child you are!

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:58.250
I just don't have the same tastes as you.

00:09:58.250 --> 00:09:59.930
Oh, by the way, where is that perverted cat?

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:01.240
He's resting for today.

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:05.060
<i>That's Melona, Menace, and Airi!</i>

00:10:05.060 --> 00:10:07.700
<i>They're the followers of the Witch of the Swampland!</i>

00:10:08.070 --> 00:10:11.320
<i>If I listen from here, I may be able to find out where she is!</i>

00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:13.500
<i>Nanael is super lucky!</i>

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:18.400
Well, either way, you two are such a sad sight, you know?

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:22.890
Menace fell into hysteria and destroyed her own home. Just what were you thinking, I wonder?

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:27.460
That was because I could not stand my servant Leina betraying me.

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:29.430
Speaking of which, Melona...

00:10:29.430 --> 00:10:32.530
You were beaten black and blue by that Vagrant Warrior, Leina, weren't you?

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:36.470
I was just a bit negligent that time!

00:10:36.470 --> 00:10:39.650
Airi! You were also completely defeated that time!

00:10:40.230 --> 00:10:43.870
<i>All of you... Who the hell cares about that!?</i>

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:47.060
<i>Don't you have more important things to talk about?</i>

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:49.870
<i>Do your jobs properly! Do your jobs!</i>

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:54.770
Huh? My head is... kind of... fuzzy...

00:10:57.230 --> 00:10:58.550
I made it!

00:11:05.050 --> 00:11:06.810
Aren't they the Witch of the Swampland's...?

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:08.830
You big-breasted woman!

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:10.340
How rude!

00:11:10.340 --> 00:11:13.810
Commoners like you are forbidden from making rude comments about

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:15.590
the body of the great Princess of Amar!

00:11:15.590 --> 00:11:19.150
If Menace has big breasts, then Melona has bouncy ones.

00:11:19.340 --> 00:11:20.470
What was that?!

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:22.110
Even though you're a spoiled brat!

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:26.540
What is this?

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:28.970
I wonder if it was carried here by the current from somewhere?

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:30.450
How revolting.

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:39.210
<i>Nanael-san!</i>

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:42.680
<i>Nanael!</i>

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:44.210
<i>You're so slow!</i>

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:46.030
<i>We're going on ahead of you!</i>

00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:48.720
<i>Hey, Wait! I said wait!</i>

00:11:55.670 --> 00:11:58.580
<i>If you don't hurry up, everything will be gone!</i>

00:11:59.140 --> 00:12:01.030
<i>Because of these wings...</i>

00:12:01.550 --> 00:12:05.410
<i>Because my left and right wings are different sizes...</i>

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:09.170
<i>They are always making fun of me.</i>

00:12:12.770 --> 00:12:14.340
<i>I will not lose!</i>

00:12:14.340 --> 00:12:15.300
<i>Even I...</i>

00:12:15.810 --> 00:12:16.960
<i>Even I...</i>

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:18.420
<i>Someday...</i>

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:23.170
<i>I will eat until my stomach is full!</i>

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:26.880
It seems as if she's still alive.

00:12:26.880 --> 00:12:29.600
It kind of looks like she's trying to eat something.

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:30.860
This angel.

00:12:30.860 --> 00:12:32.010
Angel?

00:12:32.010 --> 00:12:33.810
What is an angel doing here?

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:39.340
I want to eat grapes, too...

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:42.030
Ah, she woke up.

00:12:42.420 --> 00:12:43.970
Uwa!!

00:12:43.970 --> 00:12:45.530
It's not 'uwa', you...

00:12:45.890 --> 00:12:48.280
What is an angel doing here?

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:52.300
Could it be that you came for a blessing from this well-known hot spring here in the Swampland?

00:12:52.300 --> 00:12:57.120
No, she surely came for the sake of becoming my servant.

00:12:57.430 --> 00:12:59.080
You're both wrong.

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:03.710
By order of the Head Angel, I have come to spy on the movements of the Witch of the Swampland.

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:06.680
Ah, she told them everything.

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:10.910
An unbelievably stupid angel has come here, don't you think?

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:15.350
Did you think that we would just start running our mouths about our master?

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:17.430
<i>S-Shit!</i>

00:13:17.430 --> 00:13:21.700
<i>If I fail here in a place like this, and if I'm found out this time...</i>

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:24.500
<i>But as long as they don't find out, I should be fine. As long as they don't find out...</i>

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:26.760
<i>It's a good thing Hachi isn't here, so...</i>

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:27.810
Nanael-san.

00:13:27.810 --> 00:13:28.860
Nanael-san!

00:13:28.860 --> 00:13:30.890
<i>She's right there!</i>

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:33.620
<i>Moreover, I have a bad feeling about this!</i>

00:13:33.760 --> 00:13:35.770
Well, just what should we do?

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:39.420
<i>Well, I guess anything goes!</i>

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:48.170
Anything will do... how about a hint?

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:50.130
I understand.

00:13:50.130 --> 00:13:52.980
If you become my servant, then I will tell you.

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:54.470
Ah, that is impossible.

00:13:54.800 --> 00:13:58.670
How is it possible that you do not wish to become a servant of the great Amar Kingdom?

00:13:58.670 --> 00:14:00.390
Shut up for a minute.

00:14:00.390 --> 00:14:04.440
Is there really something to gain from telling this angel anything?

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:07.420
Of course! It won't just be for nothing!

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:13.740
If you tell me, the angel Nanael, the plans of the Witch of the Swampland, then in exchange for that...

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:15.200
In exchange for that?

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:20.330
I could tell you the location of the Vagrant Warrior, Leina, maybe?

00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:22.210
How about it? Wouldn't you like to know?

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:24.250
What was that? Leina's location?

00:14:24.510 --> 00:14:27.250
That servant is somewhere nearby?

00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:29.130
The Vagrant Warrior, Leina...

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:33.260
<i>As if! How the hell would I know where Leina is?</i>

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:34.810
<i>As expected of Nanael!</i>

00:14:35.210 --> 00:14:37.450
Okay then, I'll tell you.

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:38.350
Melona.

00:14:40.530 --> 00:14:43.140
But if you do not uphold your promise, then you will not be forgiven.

00:14:43.670 --> 00:14:45.940
Negotiations are completed!

00:14:46.180 --> 00:14:47.270
How cruel!

00:14:47.270 --> 00:14:49.070
I've heard the rumors, but...

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:50.560
To go this far is...

00:14:50.560 --> 00:14:52.490
I don't think she can even be called an angel.

00:14:54.930 --> 00:14:56.410
Queen's Blade?

00:14:56.670 --> 00:15:02.450
Yes, by order of the Witch of the Swampland, we are to prevent the trials of Queen's Blade from occurring.

00:15:02.450 --> 00:15:03.250
I see.

00:15:03.680 --> 00:15:07.750
If all of the warrior participants are killed,

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:10.720
then I can partake of as much life energy as I please.

00:15:10.990 --> 00:15:12.010
And then, and then?

00:15:12.480 --> 00:15:15.350
Everyone already knows all of that.

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:19.140
And then the great Amar Kingdom will be resurrected!

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:21.080
That's wrong!

00:15:21.080 --> 00:15:22.190
I see now.

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:25.730
Well then, we have told you our secrets.

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:27.990
As promised, you have to tell us.

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:29.030
Leina's location.

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:30.800
Okay!

00:15:30.800 --> 00:15:31.610
Um...

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:33.600
Go up that long and gentle slope over there.

00:15:33.600 --> 00:15:34.460
Long and gentle?

00:15:34.460 --> 00:15:36.300
Then there will be a back and forth path.

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:37.140
Back and forth?

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:38.270
And then a sharp and pointy thing!

00:15:38.270 --> 00:15:39.260
Sharp and pointy?

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:44.830
That's unfair!

00:15:44.830 --> 00:15:47.290
I will not let you have my servant!

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:49.100
Good luck, okay?

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:51.840
Nanael-san!

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:52.320
Ah!

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:54.630
Hachi! There you are!

00:15:54.960 --> 00:15:57.890
I didn't know what you were going to do.

00:15:57.890 --> 00:16:00.260
Now you won't be sent to the Land of the Dead.

00:16:00.380 --> 00:16:01.830
Of course not!

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:05.890
Even special assignments are a piece of cake for me.

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:07.230
Well then, how about we head home?

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:08.260
Yes!

00:16:10.160 --> 00:16:11.790
By the way, Nanael-san...

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:14.980
You knew that the Vagrant Warrior, Leina, was nearby, right?

00:16:14.980 --> 00:16:16.650
No way!

00:16:16.650 --> 00:16:18.620
Wait, Leina was really there?

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:19.240
Yup!

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:23.290
I wonder what Leina is going to do around now?

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:25.840
Probably not something peaceful and lovely.

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:28.100
As expected of three opponents...

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:30.110
She might not live through it, right?

00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:32.980
Are you worried?

00:16:32.980 --> 00:16:35.080
Worried? Never!

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:36.810
Isn't that right?

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:40.920
Whatever humans do doesn't concern us angels!

00:16:40.920 --> 00:16:41.880
That's right, that's right!

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:43.700
No relation, no relation!

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:51.620
Nanael-san doesn't care about anything to do with Queen's Blade in the first place, right?

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:53.080
She doesn't care for sure!

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:54.860
Y-yeah, pretty much!

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:59.820
Humans should just be quiet and do as we tell them to!

00:16:59.820 --> 00:17:04.790
No matter how much they struggle, they are just pawns running around in our hands, right?

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:07.750
Nanael-san?

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:13.000
Where are you going?

00:17:13.390 --> 00:17:15.880
I have something to do! Go home ahead of me!

00:17:16.390 --> 00:17:18.020
Oh my...

00:17:18.020 --> 00:17:19.890
She's so easy to read.

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:25.140
Is she around here, I wonder?

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:27.310
She could not have gone far.

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:31.560
I found her!

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:38.980
Oh, it's you again?

00:17:38.980 --> 00:17:40.570
Aren't you finished with us, already?

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:43.160
There was one very important thing I forgot.

00:17:43.710 --> 00:17:46.870
Something that is very, very important to me.

00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:48.120
Just what is it?

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:50.880
I cannot allow you to go where Leina is!

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:53.630
Just what is this angel talking about?

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:55.940
We completed the trade!

00:17:55.940 --> 00:17:57.050
That's right!

00:17:57.050 --> 00:17:59.200
You sold Leina out!

00:18:01.130 --> 00:18:05.250
Did you really think I would make a fair deal with demons in the first place?

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:08.080
An angel should honor her promises.

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:11.900
As thought, I will make this person my servant!

00:18:12.140 --> 00:18:14.950
To trick demons, you sure are brave, aren't you?

00:18:14.950 --> 00:18:15.270
But...

00:18:15.790 --> 00:18:18.800
Do you intend to face all of us by yourself?

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:19.360
Do you?

00:18:19.510 --> 00:18:23.280
I have always thought that I'd like to try an angel's life energy at least once.

00:18:23.280 --> 00:18:26.740
You will bow down before the authority of the Amar Kingdom!

00:18:32.600 --> 00:18:35.550
I am the Glorious Angel, Nanael!

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:43.890
This bitch, so easily...!

00:18:44.570 --> 00:18:45.930
Vulgar Spirits!

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:54.900
Did you demons really think you could defeat Nanael?

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:57.440
Royal Punishment Strike!

00:18:57.580 --> 00:18:59.380
Holy Dive!

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:01.870
That's as far as you go!

00:19:04.050 --> 00:19:04.850
What?

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:12.510
Falling Star Kick!

00:19:24.130 --> 00:19:25.390
That's settled.

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:29.170
Nanael-san is so cool!

00:19:34.930 --> 00:19:37.270
Nanael's report is...

00:19:37.270 --> 00:19:39.440
only full of things which we are already aware of.

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:44.920
Moreover, the Witch of the Swampland has surely been informed of our movements.

00:19:44.920 --> 00:19:47.490
So the victory against those demons is...

00:19:47.720 --> 00:19:49.020
But!

00:19:49.020 --> 00:19:50.580
I will not have your excuses.

00:19:51.740 --> 00:19:52.980
Nanael...

00:19:52.980 --> 00:19:55.460
I cannot allow you to stay in Heaven any longer.

00:19:57.060 --> 00:20:01.760
From now on, you will descend to the surface world and accompany the Vagrant Warrior, Leina, on her journey.

00:20:02.060 --> 00:20:03.590
Eh? The surface world?

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:06.080
Furthermore, travel with Leina?

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:07.210
Why?

00:20:07.210 --> 00:20:11.340
Normally, I would have no choice but to banish you to the Land of the Dead.

00:20:11.340 --> 00:20:16.730
But because Hachielle called for you to be forgiven, we accepted her proposal.

00:20:17.350 --> 00:20:22.080
Be grateful. The purpose of this is to make an apology to Leina.

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:25.280
Once in the surface world, you shall be stripped of your powers as an angel.

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:28.680
You shall never again be able to act violently.

00:20:28.680 --> 00:20:29.740
I entrust this to you.

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:30.740
Um...

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:35.670
This is?

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:37.360
That is divine milk.

00:20:37.360 --> 00:20:38.710
It is very sacred.

00:20:39.270 --> 00:20:42.550
From now on, do everything in your power not to spill that milk.

00:20:42.770 --> 00:20:43.540
Eh?

00:20:43.540 --> 00:20:44.940
That might be impossible.

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:50.300
If a time comes in which all of the milk is spilled, the Land of the Dead awaits you.

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:51.670
The Land of the Dead!

00:20:52.340 --> 00:20:54.530
Please do your best, Nanael-san!

00:21:06.590 --> 00:21:07.770
She should just fly.

00:21:12.980 --> 00:21:15.540
Somebody stop it!

00:21:21.560 --> 00:21:23.130
That hurt!

00:21:23.130 --> 00:21:24.710
What is this all of a sudden?

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:27.220
Oh no, what, what?

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:28.630
Just what is this?

00:21:30.900 --> 00:21:33.220
Half of the bottle is already spilled...

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:35.110
If it isn't Nanael!

00:21:35.110 --> 00:21:37.290
Do you have some kind of grudge against me?

00:21:38.170 --> 00:21:41.440
More importantly, the precious divine milk is...!

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:48.590
wasurenai kara anata no koto

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:48.590
忘れないから貴方のこと

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:48.590
I won't forget about you

00:21:48.590 --> 00:21:52.410
donna ni jikan ga hettemo

00:21:48.590 --> 00:21:52.410
どんなに時間が経っても

00:21:48.590 --> 00:21:52.410
No matter how much time passes

00:21:52.410 --> 00:22:01.130
umaku ienai kimochi bakari afurete kuru

00:21:52.410 --> 00:22:01.130
うまく言えない気持ちばかり溢れてくる

00:21:52.410 --> 00:22:01.130
I can't express my overflowing feelings well

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:15.060
kizutsuita sono bun dake

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:15.060
傷ついたその分だけ

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:15.060
Hurting will, to an extent,

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:19.230
tsuyoku narerundato kigatsuite

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:19.230
強くなれるんだと気がついて

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:19.230
Make you realize how much stronger you can become

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:24.310
takaku tooku ton demiseru

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:24.310
高く遠く飛んでみせる

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:24.310
You can fly high and far away

00:22:24.310 --> 00:22:29.200
hisoka ni jibun to chikatta

00:22:24.310 --> 00:22:29.200
密かに自分と誓った

00:22:24.310 --> 00:22:29.200
Surely and secretly for yourself

00:22:29.840 --> 00:22:37.580
kiseki wa itsumo dareka no kimagure

00:22:29.840 --> 00:22:37.580
奇跡はいつも誰かの気まぐれ

00:22:29.840 --> 00:22:37.580
Miracles are always fickle for everyone

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:42.460
onnaji sora no shitani aru nara

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:42.460
おんなじ空の下にあるなら

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:42.460
If we are under the same sky

00:22:42.690 --> 00:22:49.200
keshite akirametari shinai

00:22:42.690 --> 00:22:49.200
けして諦めたりしない

00:22:42.690 --> 00:22:49.200
We will never give up

00:22:50.010 --> 00:22:55.460
wasurenai kara ano hi no koto

00:22:50.010 --> 00:22:55.460
忘れないからあの日のこと

00:22:50.010 --> 00:22:55.460
I won't forget about that day

00:22:55.460 --> 00:22:59.180
donna ni jikan ga tattemo

00:22:55.460 --> 00:22:59.180
どんなに時間が経っても

00:22:55.460 --> 00:22:59.180
No matter how much time passes by

00:22:59.180 --> 00:23:08.050
umaku ienai kimochi bakari afuretekuru

00:22:59.180 --> 00:23:08.050
うまく言えない気持ちばかり溢れてくる

00:22:59.180 --> 00:23:08.050
Confusing feelings overflow in my heart

00:23:14.100 --> 00:23:19.330
At last, you've been moved by the burning feelings of the superior Nanael, haven't you?

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:23.880
Finally, from now on, I will reap the fruits of my labor! Get it? I will forever be the main character!

00:23:23.880 --> 00:23:26.260
This time, something important is happening in an underdeveloped region.

00:23:26.260 --> 00:23:31.470
But because of the Head Angel's instructions not to spill the divine milk,

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:32.920
Nanael regretfully can't become the savior!

00:23:32.920 --> 00:23:35.760
This is a very depressing situation for the holy angel Nanael!

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:38.050
Next time: Secret Maneuver ~ Fang of the Assassin!

00:23:38.050 --> 00:23:41.000
Let us be guided by the battles that take place here!

00:23:41.000 --> 00:23:43.400
Ah, how depressing, how depressing.
